# Pairs with EventualConvergence. Reproduces production before #4651 (#4614): a
# batch the shipper cannot encode is parked on the source's own dead-letter
# queue and the cursor advances past it. A replay there is an own-origin no-op,
# and nothing requests a re-seed, so the peer never receives the write.
MODULE: EventualConvergenceShipDeadLetterNeverReseeds
TARGET: EventualConvergence
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: an encode dead letter skips the entry and requests no re-seed, so the peer never receives it
PERTURBS: ShipDeadLetter

--- FIND
       /\ skipped' = skipped \cup {i}
       /\ requested' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
       /\ skipped' = skipped \cup {i}
\* MUTATION: no re-seed is requested.
       /\ requested' = requested
--- END
